	"notes": "One case per source state: `canChangeTo` returns true for `allowed_targets` and false for every other state, including the source state itself. Refusals are reported by the legacy state framework as states.messages.change.failure.transitionNotAllowed (StateChangeContextBuilderImpl.java:64, StateExecutorService.java:175,201). A null source state is the initial workflow assignment and is permitted by the same guard.",
	"refusal_error": "states.messages.change.failure.transitionNotAllowed",
